        <mxCell id="78" value="Processes 4.0 to 7.0 also write an audit event to D9. Those repeated lines are left off this page. Process 8.0 is the one that reads the log.&lt;br&gt;Reports are the application list (Excel or PDF), the financial summary (Excel or PDF), and beneficiaries by barangay (CSV).&lt;br&gt;Staff can verify, evaluate, or approve only with that permission and a workflow-staff row. An administrator skips that check.&lt;br&gt;Release methods are cash, bank, e-wallet, check, and other. A claim is matched on a reference, a QR code, or a CAMS number." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
